  "text": "SPEAKER_02: Oh, yep.\nSPEAKER_00: Come in.\nSPEAKER_00: Hi.\nSPEAKER_00: Welcome.\nSPEAKER_00: Please have a seat.\nSPEAKER_00: Thank you so much.\nSPEAKER_00: Oh, is he over coffee as well?\nSPEAKER_00: Thank you so much.\nSPEAKER_00: Anything else you need before we start?\nSPEAKER_00: No, thank you.\nSPEAKER_00: Okay.\nSPEAKER_00: Good. Excellent.\nSPEAKER_00: So, how can I help you today?\nSPEAKER_00: So, I'm <PERSON_1>.\nSPEAKER_00: Nice to meet you.\nSPEAKER_00: What's your name?\nSPEAKER_00: My name is <PERSON_2>.\nSPEAKER_01: Nice to meet you.\nSPEAKER_01: Hello.\nSPEAKER_01: So, I've moved in to Finland from England a while ago.\nSPEAKER_01: And I know I am realizing that it is very difficult to balance my full-time job and taking care of my three-year-old daughter.\nSPEAKER_01: Oh, yes.\nSPEAKER_01: And so, I would like to inquire you about some day care options.\nSPEAKER_01: Okay.\nSPEAKER_01: And whatever I might need to relate to that because I'm not very familiar with it.\nSPEAKER_01: That's work",
